    "description": {
      "value": "<p>If the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} receives the &amp;Reference[Prone] condition, roll a die. On an odd number, it has the &amp;Reference[Incapacitated] condition. At the end of each of its turns, the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} makes a DC 10 Dexterity saving throw, ending the Incapacitated condition on a success.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-8XJsmO9ytpuGV8aC\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Roll a die</em> lance 1d6 : sur un résultat impair, appliquez l’effet <em>Prone Deficiency</em> (Incapacitated) au flumph. À la fin de chacun de ses tours, <em>End Incapacitated</em> lance le Dexterity saving throw DC 10 ; retirez l’effet sur une réussite.</p></section>",
